    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あっ、先輩！　勝ちましたよバレーの試合に！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたしと猫っちで、奇跡の大逆転をしちゃいましたよ〜っ！　きゃ〜っ、嬉しいっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「へへっ。対戦相手はうちのクラスだったんで、実際あたし裏切りものなんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「みんな『楽しかったからいいよ』って言ってくれたんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「よかったぁ。一時はどうなることかと思ってましたけど、何とかなりましたねっ。先輩のおかげです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「って、抱きついてすみません！　テンションあがっちゃって、あはは♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あぁ、いや！　先輩に授業サボらせるわけにはいきませんしっ、あたしと猫っちだけで何とかなりましたから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「約束どおり、休み時間だけお手伝いしてくれればいいんですよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「それで、じゅうぶん助けになってますし♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「さぁ、次の現場に向かいましょう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「えぇっと、次は〜っと。まずいな、放送部の仕事ぜんぜんしてないや。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「放送部、人手不足なんだよなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「放送機材だけ持ちだして、あちこち駆け巡って、その場のノリで実況って感じでいけるかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
